fixture landing_jump_dash_falls_with_gravity
doc Movement review 6, M2 (the leak): the air jump spent on 0, a jump buffered into the landing (26), a dash on 27 off test/cliff's edge. The first tick after the dash falls with full gravity (213 sub-pixels a tick), as a plain ground dash off the same edge does (landing_jump_dash_falls_control). Before the fix the jump's "not risen yet" flag outlived the dash and that tick skipped gravity (vy 0).
room test/cliff
spawn 800 200
frames 70
input
  0 jump
  24 jump
  27 R dash
  28..69 R
end
expect
  at 26 event.land=1 event.jump=1
  at 27 event.dash=1
  at 36 dash_frame=0 vy=213
  at 37 vy=426
end
